     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: talking about health",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "想改善「公共卫生」，你觉得可以从什么习惯开始？",
       "alumno": "To improve «Public health», which habit do you think is the best place to start?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "目前的材料支持一个初步判断，但还不足以证明因果关系。",
       "alumno": "The current material supports a provisional judgement, but it is not enough to prove a causal link.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "还需要哪些补充信息？",
       "alumno": "What additional information would be needed?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "需要扩大样本，并比较不同群体的处境。",
       "alumno": "The sample would need to be widened, and the situation of different groups compared.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果新材料与原来的结论相反呢？",
       "alumno": "What if the new material contradicts the original conclusion?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "那就应修正判断，并说明证据的适用范围。",
       "alumno": "Then the judgement should be revised and the scope of the evidence explained.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: talking about health",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "改善「公共卫生」要结合个人情况，不能照搬别人的做法。",
       "alumno": "To improve «Public health», you need to take personal circumstances into account and not simply copy what others do.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果出现明显或持续的症状，应及时向专业人员求助。",
       "alumno": "If severe or persistent symptoms appear, it is advisable to consult a professional promptly.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "分析时应区分可以观察到的事实与个人解释，也要比较不同立场所依据的材料。",
       "alumno": "When analysing, distinguish observable facts from personal interpretations, and compare the sources that back each position.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "即使材料呈现相似趋势，也不能在缺乏证据时直接断定因果关系。",
       "alumno": "Even if the material shows similar trends, a causal link must not be asserted without sufficient evidence.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "结尾应概括主要结论，同时说明证据的局限和结论适用的范围。",
       "alumno": "The conclusion should sum up the main idea and point out the limits of the evidence and the scope of what is claimed.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
